    "sections": {
        "description": "OrionX is a lightweight and flexible WordPress theme designed for blogs, business websites, portfolios, and online stores. Built with Elementor compatibility in mind, it allows you to create custom page layouts using Elementor while maintaining a clean and responsive foundation. The theme includes multiple layout options, customizable header styles, sidebar configurations, WooCommerce integration, content hook locations, RTL language support, and translation-ready code. With extensive Customizer settings and live preview support, OrionX makes it easy to personalize your website without touching code. Whether you're creating a personal blog, agency website, portfolio, corporate website, or eCommerce store, OrionX provides a modern, performance-focused foundation that works seamlessly with WordPress and popular plugins."
    },
